OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot in the leg and hit with
OL,4,Airon bars by masked men
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been shot in the leg after
OL,7,Ffour masked men, one armed with a
OL,8,Fhandgun, entered a house in County
OL,9,FAntrim on Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe man was also hit on the head and
OL,12,Farms with iron bars at the property in
OL,13,FStraham View in Dervock, near
OL,14,FBallymoney shortly after 00:30 GMT.
OL,16,FThe masked men then made off in a
OL,17,FToyota Yaris, which was later found
OL,18,Fburnt out in Burnquarter Road.
OL,20,FThree other people who were in the
OL,21,Fhouse at the time were uninjured but
OL,22,Fleft badly shaken by their ordeal.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
